div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-156071\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-156071\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Am. L.L. 2021/126, 11/7/2021, eff. 11/7/2022; Am. L.L. 2023/077, 6/11/2023, eff. 6/11/2023) \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-156072\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-156072\"></AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"EdNoteSm\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Editor's note:</span> For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCadmin/0-0-0-135195', hash: '#JD_L.L.2021/126' }}\">L.L. 2021/126</Link> and <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCadmin/0-0-0-224061', hash: '#JD_L.L.2023/077' }}\">L.L. 2023/077</Link>. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div>",
